XIO BACKEND

The backend is target-specific.

Supported initial targets:
    x86_64
    aarch64

Backend stages:
    legalization
    instruction selection
    register allocation
    stack frame
    ABI lowering
    scheduling
    encoding
    relocation
    ELF emission

The backend must consume IR, not source code.

No C/C++/Rust/Python implementation is defined here.
Bootstrap is temporary and will eventually be replaced by XIO.
